    ["orb.runtime.automation_owner_missing"] = "The ordinary automation owner is not available; no Orb action will be sent.",
    ["orb.runtime.blocked_cannot_confirm"] = "{subject} is blocked: an earlier Orb action cannot be confirmed. If this record retains an observation of this spend and has no usable recorded choice, and no offer is open, Continue in /nexus orbs ends this block after its read-only check passes and your confirmation; Nexus does not clear it by itself. Open /nexus orbs for details.",
    ["orb.runtime.blocked_observes_after_reload"] = "{subject} is blocked: an earlier Orb action is unresolved after a reload. Nexus only observes it and sends nothing. The block ends when that action is confirmed or, if this record retains an observation of this spend and has no usable recorded choice, and no offer is open, when Continue's read-only check passes and you confirm it. Open /nexus orbs for the current instruction.",
